  "created": 1763551912721,
  "description": "This automation handles the processing that needs to be done when a Build Deviation and/or Eng. Requirement Deviation is created via all 3 methods: Jira Forms, Jira Actions (automation), and Jira Create.\n\nEng. Requirement Deviation:\n1. Populate the SIT/Attribute (Assets) field with the value of the SIT text field.\n2. Checks if Assignee is empty during creation, if so, reporter will be set as assignee.\n3. Populate Collaborators field based on Requirement Level value.\n\nBuild Deviation:\n1. Checks if Parts is empty during creation, if so, populate SIT/Attribute (Assets) field with the value of the SIT from the Parts field.\n2. Checks if Assignee is empty during creation, if so, reporter will be set as assignee.",
  "id": 30856743,
  "idUuid": "019a9be2-a312-70db-bc8b-7c622e6ed11d",
